<p class="note legend">Signs: <span class="ok">✓ deep covered</span>, <span class="partial">! covered, gap below</span>, <span class="missing">✗ not covered</span>, <span class="rejected">– rejected</span>, <span class="unknown">? unknown type (an error)</span>.</p>
